        {
          "text": "Nĩnĩite asyaĩĩsya maũvainĩ maku, we Yelusaleme; matikavindya mũthenya kana ũtukũ: inyw’ĩ ala mũmũlilikanasya Yeova, mũikathũmũe, ",
